        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Peak_Place,_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community sits at 35.7912°N latitude and 105.9432°W longitude, placing it in the heart of Santa Fe County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
