      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Peak_Place,_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Most residents attend Pojoaque Valley High School, the zoned school for the Pojoaque Valley area.",
